ticolar modo un fan che offre loro un passaggio, con il solo intento di sedarle e rapirle. Le ragazze si risvegliano in una gigantesca arena ricavata in una discarica di rottami. I loro corpi sono stati mutilati e gli arti sostituiti da asce, trapani e motoseghe. Un sadistico Imperatore, adulato dai suoi folli sudditi, le ha trasformate in gladiatrici."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In a godforsaken bar in the middle of nowhere, an all-girl band – Ms. 45 – rips the stage apart with their punk spirit. But their performance impresses an enthusiastic fan who lures the girls into a trap, sedates them, and starts…customizing them. Slowly they begin to gain consciousness and, in total shock, realize their arms have all been replaced with axes and chainsaws to fight gladiator-style in a junkyard arena owned by a sadistic \"emperor,\" forcing them into the battle of their lives with one prize in mind – their freedom.","tagline":"Let the battle begin"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sPZ3jxWQ1clnxsdeEk6cObU2tp0.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zJyJiCYKSCsSO83qtBkVdqCa9ZJ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":716819,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sPZ3jxWQ1clnxsdeEk6cObU2tp0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sPZ3jxWQ1clnxsdeEk6cObU2tp0.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sPZ3jxWQ1clnxsdeEk6cObU2tp0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sPZ3jxWQ1clnxsdeEk6cObU2tp0.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y0MFoalgfvG3ZI4JGwBvd6xuOV2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y0